               <value>
                  <exData contentType="text/html">
                     <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">Eligibility Requirements</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">•<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">    </span><span style="font-weight:bold"> Graduate from a California high school<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></span>(unless due to military orders that required you or your parent or<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span>guardian be out of<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">       </span>state at the time of your graduation) or<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span>have completed a high school graduation equivalency (including GED or the California</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">       </span>High School Proficiency Exam) on or after June 30,<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">          </span>.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">•<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">     </span>Be a<span style="font-weight:bold"> California resident at the time of your high school graduation</span>, or its equivalent</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">•<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">     </span>Earn a verified cumulative<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="font-weight:bold">Community College GPA of at least 2.4</span></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">•<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">     </span>Attended and completed at least one term at a CA Community College and be transferring or transferred to a CA baccalaureate</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">       </span>degree granting institution<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">                                               </span><span style="xfa-tab-count:3">                           </span></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">•<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">     </span><span style="font-weight:bold">Be no more than 27 years of age</span> by December 31 in the year of first award</p></body>
                  </exData>
               </value>
